<title>GERMANY: Mannesmann to buy 8.26 pct stake in OSR.</title>
<headline>Mannesmann to buy 8.26 pct stake in OSR.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mannesmann AG said it will acquire an 8.26 percent stake in OSR from Olivetti for 430 million marks.</p>
<p>Mannesmann said the deal will raise its stake in the mobile phone network Omintel Pronto Italy to more than 11 percent.</p>
<p>The 8.26 percent stake in OSR corresponds to an indirect 5.8 percent stake in Omnitel Pronto Italia, the company said.</p>
<p>Previously, Mannesmann had a 5.9 percent stake in Omnitel.</p>
<p>Mannesmann also said has an option to October 1999 to expand its Omnitel stake to about 14 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 260 970</p>
</text>
